<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia TV3 year net down 65 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia TV3 year net down 65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Aug 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net Profit	    13.51	   vs	   38.68</p>
<p>    Group share (cents) 15.00	   vs	   46.00</p>
<p>    Turnover	     231.46	   vs	  210.13</p>
<p>    Pre tax profit	21.95	   vs	   51.00</p>
<p>    Minorities	     0.73	   vs   (less) 0.15</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)   8.00	   vs	   10.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the company is Sistem Televisyen Malaysia Bhd. It is the operator of a private television station.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
